BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Protect Your Website from ADA Claims Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261008T110000
UID:2a935f308bf2e4d738c47021131dfc41@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:From Compliance to Confidence - Protecting your Website from A
 DA Claims! Justin Landskron is the founder of QnC\, a Petaluma based compa
 ny helping small businesses with web accessibility and AI. With 30+ years 
 of experience including a multiyear CCPA/ADA remediation effort spanning o
 ver 100\,000 public facing pages. Come hear Justin discuss: - What ADA web
  accessibility actually means - What does FULL COMPLIANCE mean vs partial 
 compliance - How to check your own site for FREE - A hands on walkthrough 
 of the most common issues - How to build a simple Accessibility Statement 
 page
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/protect-your-websi
 te-from-ada-claims-workshop
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
