DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261020T190000
UID:6be01ce25f75b2f4811792ce0bcd9af0@growthzone.com
DESCRIPTION:The Petaluma Educational Foundation is excited to host our ann
 ual TK & Kindergarten Info Night on Tuesday\, October 20\, 2026\, from 5:3
 0 – 7:00 p.m. at the Petaluma Women’s Club\, 518 B Street\, Petaluma. 
 This free community event is designed to help families explore options for
  their child’s early education journey. Representatives from local schoo
 ls and districts will be on hand to share their programs\, learning philos
 ophies\, and enrollment processes. The evening begins with a short present
 ation and Q&A session\, followed by time to visit school information table
 s. Families will have the opportunity to: Meet educators and school repres
 entatives Explore different learning environments and philosophies Learn h
 ow to register for the upcoming school year Whether you are brand new to t
 he process or looking to explore school options\, this evening is a valuab
 le way to get your questions answered and your plans started. Event Detail
 s Tuesday\, October 20\, 2026 5:30 – 7:00 p.m. Petaluma Women’s Clu
URL:https://business.petalumachamber.com/events/details/pef-s-3rd-annual-t
 k-kindergarten-info-night
X-SOURCE:Petaluma Chamber of Commerce
END:VEVENT
